    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0d85\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc0\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dd9\u0da0\u0db1\u0dca\u0dbb \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dca\u0dc1\u0dca \u0d9a \u0dba\u0dd4\u0dd4\u0dbb \u0dc3\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dca\u0dc1\u0dca \u0dbb\u0dd0\u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dcf \u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dca\u200d\u0dba \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf) (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bcd \u0ba9\u0bb9\u0bc8\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0bc6\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe - \u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bb2\u0bc1\u0bc6\u0bb2\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd \u0bc8\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0ba8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1 \u0ba9\u0bc6\u0bae\u0bb2\u0bc6\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0baf\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bc6\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b85\u0bae\u0bc8\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0bc6\u0bb0\u0bcd) (The Hon. Arun Hemachandra - Deputy Minister of Foreign Affairs and Foreign Employment) Hon. Presiding Member, before responding, on behalf of the Minister of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism, to these specific questions raised by the Hon. Rauff Hakeem, I wish to briefly place this matter in its broader context.\n\nSri Lanka facilitated the dignified repatriation of the remains of the deceased personnel and has also facilitated the repatriation of 238 Iranian sailors to Iran. These arrangements were carried out through close coordination among the relevant Sri Lankan authorities and in communication with the Iranian side, reflecting Sri Lanka\u2019s long-standing approach of extending humanitarian assistance where circumstances require it.\n\nThe Government continues to address the remaining matters through the appropriate diplomatic, defence and administrative channels with due regard to the humanitarian considerations involved and Sri Lanka\u2019s sovereignty, security and international responsibilities.\n\nSir, in that background, I will now respond to the specific questions raised by the Hon. Rauff Hakeem.\n\n1. Yes.\n\n2. According to the Ministry of Defence, the Sri Lanka Navy has raised no objection to the proposed replacement on humanitarian grounds, subject to the decision of other stakeholders.\n\n3. The Government of Sri Lanka is ready to facilitate repatriation without delay.\n\n4. The Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism, in coordination with the relevant stakeholders, is taking necessary action with a view to facilitate the Iranian request.\n\n5. Not relevant.\n\nThank you.\n\n1525 1526\n\n2026 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0dca \u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6 11"
  },
