    "chunk_text": "(\u0b87) \u0bb5\u0baa\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb2.\n\n(a) (i) The number of traditional medical practitioners is 17,534. The number of registered graduate Ayurvedic medical practitioners is 4,711.\n\n\u2018\n\n(ii) Graduate Ayurvedic Medical Practitioners\n\nTraditional Medical Practitioners\n\nSince traditional medical practitioners acquire their knowledge and skills through hereditary transmission, the \u201cteacher-student system\u201d or private training, the Government generally does not incur any direct financial expenditure on their trainings. However, certain administrative costs are incurred by institutions such as the Ayurvedic Medical Council and the Department of Ayurveda in relation to their registrations, evaluations and professional development programmes.\n\n(iii) Graduate Ayurvedic Medical Practitioners"
