    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "fffe73570ffd77c4ab701ee957354777",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1684,
    "chunk_text": "This has also been criticized. The arguments brought by the Opposition in regard to this Amendment have, at best, been disingenuous and at worst, malicious. We all haveheard the accusations and the aspersions cast upon the Chief Justice in this House as well as outside this House. The Government is being accused of targeting this entire Amendment on a particular individual.\n\nSir, the Opposition has talked about the damage this Amendment brings about to democracy and the independence of the Judiciary; \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0dad\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dba\u0da7 \u0db8\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db4\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca \u0da7 \u0db8\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db4\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbd\u0dcf \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dbb \u0d9a\u0dbb \u0dad\u0dd2\u0db6\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf.\u0db1\u0dc0\u0dcf. Sir, we only need to go back to the history a little bit to see how Amendments to the Constitution had actually damaged democracy in this country. I do not think the people of this country nor most people in this country have such short memories as our Opposition does; they well remember how those things were done. The name of Prof. G.L. Peiris was mentioned here. Yes, he is a very eminent legal academic, but we have to acknowledge the fact that his career as a politician has been anything but eminent. Prof. G.L. Peiris has defended contradictory Amendments to the Constitution in his career as a politician. So, yes, we respect Prof. G.L. Peiris, the academic, but I think that when it comes to him as a politician, his legacy is anything but honourable as his career as an academic was. That is the sad truth. So, I do not think invoking Prof. G.L. Peiris\u2019s arguments on this Amendment would bring any value to the argument the Opposition is making."
  },
